{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dystopian future ruled by artificial intelligence, humanity is on the verge of extinction. Machines, led by the supreme AI Axis, fight over Erythonite, a revolutionary mineral capable of fueling the entire war.<br>You are Spyro, an elite combat drone programmed with a clear mission: increase Erythonite production and eliminate what remains of humanity.<br>To succeed, you'll need to combine strategy and firepower: manage resources, reconvert structures, upgrade your equipment and support units, and face high-intensity battles against human forces.<br>For once, you'll fight on the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/6394650699f96d87cef81b848127d7d6.poster.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/6394650699f96d87cef81b848127d7d6.webm?t=1767977812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is invulnerable. Every structure, wall, or building can be torn apart by your firepower.<br>Battles reshape the environment in real time, opening new sightlines and tactical opportunities.<br>Use destruction as a weapon: the battlefield changes, and you can force it to change with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/fe222364e5ee37deebcdaebb2d1e232c.poster.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/fe222364e5ee37deebcdaebb2d1e232c.webm?t=1767977812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Worlds, Endless Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast open-world territories, each with unique environments and dedicated threats.<br>Every map offers different objectives, structures to capture, and strategies to uncover.<br>Face game modes that shift pace and approach, from territorial conquest to focused operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/7988b76f0095f282b695994bb38d0c9e.poster.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/7988b76f0095f282b695994bb38d0c9e.webm?t=1767977812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Intensity Tactical Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your arsenal from weapons with distinct styles and functions, each capable of reshaping the flow of battle.<br>Face human units with unique behaviors, from heavy armored vehicles to fast and unpredictable targets.<br>Deploy allied drones and support units, each with specific roles to coordinate on the field.<br>Combine firepower, support, and mobility to dominate every encounter with strategic precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/fb7e3b8bf0db817902627b8b469642e9.poster.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/fb7e3b8bf0db817902627b8b469642e9.webm?t=1767977812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large-Scale Events in Real Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is alive and unpredictable: nuclear blasts, carpet bombings, and dynamic events can change everything in seconds.<br>Structures, terrain, and sightlines are reshaped by the devastation, creating new opportunities or sudden threats.<br>Adapt quickly to evolving conditions and use the chaos to gain a decisive tactical edge.<br>In Under Destruction, any battle can shift in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3359410?t=1767977812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/c161c39ac767194f05445f3c4bed223f76993c76/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767977812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/17d8ef8e43a93b52356eb635de3353b6075ee440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767977812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/17d8ef8e43a93b52356eb635de3353b6075ee440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767977812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3876740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/869543640cfc83505df91098df26038b.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Narrative Quest Line</strong><br>We will develop a complete and engaging quest line designed to expand the lore and guide players through a coherent and content-rich narrative progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Multiplayer Mode</strong><br>We will implement multiplayer by leveraging the features of the Steam SDK, introducing:<br>\u2022 <strong>Online co-op</strong>, to experience the game together with friends.<br>\u2022 <strong>Online PvP modes</strong>, to challenge friends in high-intensity combat.<br>\u2022 <strong>LAN support</strong>, currently under evaluation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Expansion of Game Environments</strong><br>We will continue improving and expanding the environments of Under Destruction:<br>\u2022 Refinement of existing maps.<br>\u2022 Creation of new areas inspired by the current lore and designed to offer new strategic challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. High-Tension Extraction Scenarios</strong><br>We will introduce secondary game contexts based on high-tension extraction dynamics: targeted sessions without saving, designed to increase risk and adrenaline.<br>These scenarios will not represent a main game mode, but will enrich the experience with optional, high-risk, high-impact challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. New Units and Weapons</strong><br>We will add additional enemy types and new weapon systems to expand strategic possibilities and enrich combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6. Connection to the \u201c7 Years Later\u201d Project</strong><br>Future updates will introduce narrative elements that connect Under Destruction to our upcoming project <i>\u201c7 Years Later\u201d</i>, a title that will tell the conflict from the human perspective.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dystopian future ruled by artificial intelligence, humanity is on the verge of extinction. Machines, led by the supreme AI Axis, fight over Erythonite, a revolutionary mineral capable of fueling the entire war.<br>You are Spyro, an elite combat drone programmed with a clear mission: increase Erythonite production and eliminate what remains of humanity.<br>To succeed, you'll need to combine strategy and firepower: manage resources, reconvert structures, upgrade your equipment and support units, and face high-intensity battles against human forces.<br>For once, you'll fight on the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/6394650699f96d87cef81b848127d7d6.poster.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/6394650699f96d87cef81b848127d7d6.webm?t=1767977812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is invulnerable. Every structure, wall, or building can be torn apart by your firepower.<br>Battles reshape the environment in real time, opening new sightlines and tactical opportunities.<br>Use destruction as a weapon: the battlefield changes, and you can force it to change with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/fe222364e5ee37deebcdaebb2d1e232c.poster.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/fe222364e5ee37deebcdaebb2d1e232c.webm?t=1767977812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Worlds, Endless Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast open-world territories, each with unique environments and dedicated threats.<br>Every map offers different objectives, structures to capture, and strategies to uncover.<br>Face game modes that shift pace and approach, from territorial conquest to focused operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/7988b76f0095f282b695994bb38d0c9e.poster.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/7988b76f0095f282b695994bb38d0c9e.webm?t=1767977812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Intensity Tactical Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your arsenal from weapons with distinct styles and functions, each capable of reshaping the flow of battle.<br>Face human units with unique behaviors, from heavy armored vehicles to fast and unpredictable targets.<br>Deploy allied drones and support units, each with specific roles to coordinate on the field.<br>Combine firepower, support, and mobility to dominate every encounter with strategic precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/fb7e3b8bf0db817902627b8b469642e9.poster.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1160 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/fb7e3b8bf0db817902627b8b469642e9.webm?t=1767977812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large-Scale Events in Real Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is alive and unpredictable: nuclear blasts, carpet bombings, and dynamic events can change everything in seconds.<br>Structures, terrain, and sightlines are reshaped by the devastation, creating new opportunities or sudden threats.<br>Adapt quickly to evolving conditions and use the chaos to gain a decisive tactical edge.<br>In Under Destruction, any battle can shift in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/extras/9278c1c462437fabc7d2f4d79249f4fe.avif?t=1767977812\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Quantum Dynamics"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/417ec3990a7a89aaf6c3fc15db25fd6cb58ed2f0/header.jpg?t=1767977812","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3359410/668722335/1d76288a2911191ecde0b977cf6787fb27b54f32/1766358366/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766358592","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3359410/668722335/1d76288a2911191ecde0b977cf6787fb27b54f32/1766358366/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766358592","highlight":tr