pg?t=1767977812","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/590d298721e32693025f3a34521a0ec1f2636c4c/ss_590d298721e32693025f3a34521a0ec1f2636c4c.600x338.jpg?t=1767977812"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/f3cb910d69faace90c145c62676d9c86dc41ad12/ss_f3cb910d69faace90c145c62676d9c86dc41ad12.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767977812","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359410/f3cb910d69faace90c145c62676d9c86dc41ad12/ss_f3cb910d69faace90c145c62676d9c86dc41ad12.600x338.jpg?t=1767977812"}],"short_description":"In a future ruled by machines, humanity is near its end. You are Spyro, an elite drone tasked with boosting Erythonite production and destroying the last human forces. Manage resources, upgrade units, and fight to secure Axis' dominance.","steam_appid":3359410,"support_info":{"email":"info@quantumdynamicsgames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":null}